  "title": "Mawson Infrastructure Group Inc. Announces Participation in Metro Connect USA 2025",
  "summary": "Mawson Infrastructure Group Inc. (NASDAQ: MIGI) (\"Mawson\" or \"the Company\"), a publicly-traded technology company focused on digital infrastructure platforms for artificial intelligence (AI), high-performance computing (HPC), and digital assets, announced today that it will participate in Metro Connect USA 2025, taking place on February 24-26, 2025 in Fort Lauderdale.",
